  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それにしても……日にちを間違えたのは仕方ないけど、\r\n電話は出なくちゃダメじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花に何かあったのかもしれないって、心配したんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ごめんなさい……\r\n迷惑、かけちゃった……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "えっと……その……電話があったとき、寝てて……\r\n気づかなかった……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "起きて、かけ直そうって、思ったんだけど……\r\nお休みだから……いっかなって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな……でも今度からは、\r\n気づいたらすぐ返すようにしてくれ。俺も心配になるから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010170,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……そうする……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ま、それはそれとしてだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ふぇ……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花は普段、ずいぶんゆるっとした服を着てるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あうぅ……あれは……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010200,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "楽だから……\r\n家では、いつも……あんな感じ……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010210,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "家から、あんまり出ないし……いいかなって……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、外に出なければたしかにそうなるか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010220,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、来るって……\r\n思ってなかった……から……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、いきなり部屋に入ったのは俺だからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お……もうそろそろ、レッスン場だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010230,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……ごめんね、甜花のせいで……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も間違えることはあるしな。お互い様だよ\r\nそれより、覚悟はいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010240,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……ちゃんと……謝る……\r\nプロデューサーさんと……一緒に……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500301/2015003010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003010250,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……ありがとう、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
